WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.320
Take your seats.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.100
I'm going to call the roll.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:14.930
Aizawa.

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:15.610
Here.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.980
Akaishi.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:18.650
Here.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.830
<i>She's hopeless.</i>

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:23.290
<i>I guess I'll answer for her.</i>

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:24.790
Amami.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:25.790
Here.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:26.980
Present.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.790
Show me your panties!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.610
L-Let's try that again.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:34.550
Amami.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:35.680
Here.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:36.630
Present.

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.250
One deluxe helping of panty shots!

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:44.160
Y-You have too many people
answering for you, you idiot!

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:18.490
And... update!

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:20.400
Blogging again?

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.000
I've gotten hooked on this lately.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.950
And with this class, I'm never short of things to blog about.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.810
I'm so sorry! I dozed off!

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.340
Nope, no way, no chance!

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:59.200
There's no such thing as ghosts.
No such thing as ghosts. No such thing...

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.190
So Amami can see ghosts...

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:05.170
And Inoue's so terrified, she refuses to accept it.

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:09.210
There's a lot of them around today.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.160
I bet they're the ones who answered the roll for her.

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.190
So they show up in pictures.

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:21.670
Yeah. That's why I can post them to my blog.

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:26.210
Why are you so sleepy today?

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:27.780
Well...

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:31.210
I had a dream last night,

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.860
and in it...

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:38.650
Hey, baby.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.250
Let me see those panties.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.750
No!

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.760
Let me see those panties.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.760
No!

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:04.770
Let me see those panties!

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:06.770
No!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:12.770
It went on all night,
until I finally said "okay."

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.710
What an awful nightmare about sexual harassment.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.580
Dreams like that are all in your head.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.460
Come on, let's get you to the infirmary.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.770
You need some rest.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.610
Thank you.

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.540
Inoue's so nice.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.870
Inoue gives me such great pictures.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:56.860
No way! I refuse to believe this is a ghost!

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.610
It wasn't a ghost. It wasn't a ghost.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.430
It wasn't a ghost...

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:07.230
Welcome back, Amami. Are you okay now?

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:10.080
Yes, I feel much better. Thank you.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.830
Did you sleep soundly?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.000
Yes.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.200
I had another dream,

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:18.770
but this time a boy shouting
"Heaven's wrath!" saved me.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.330
"Heaven's wrath"?

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.740
That'd be the "present" guy.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:31.690
Most likely.

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:37.930
I'm kinda surprised no one really picks on Amami.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.150
Why's that?

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.940
You know, that whole ghost thing normally would have made her a target.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.630
I guess... Maybe people are afraid of being haunted.

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:50.950
What I fear...

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:55.700
is that bullying her could cause her to
transform into something wholly different.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.380
Like a brutal sadist!

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:03.750
There are times when humans
can be scarier than ghosts, though.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.100
You said it.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:16.400
Whether I fear ghosts or humans more...

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.040
That was your question?

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.820
They were talking about it, so I wondered.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.780
What scares me is...

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.030
Show me those panties!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.290
C-Cats...

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.160
Why are you holding your skirt?

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:32.980
What about you, Inoue?

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.450
D-Don't ask me dumb questions like that.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.370
I guess I don't have to ask.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:40.980
O-Obviously...

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:50.310
Humans are scarier!

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:52.520
Your spirit guardian's your grandma, after all.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.660
And what about you, Uehara?

00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:59.760
I'd say humans.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:02.490
I mean, look.

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:08.130
Nothing can compare to this kind of carnal desire.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:09.540
Wow.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.390
And you, Esumi?

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:14.710
Let's see...

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:16.540
Ghosts, I guess.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.450
Wow, I'm surprised.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.550
You have this cool demeanor about you, so I figured...

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:25.550
After all, if it's a human I'm up against...

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.220
I can just punch them.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.340
Nothing less from the ex-gangster...

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:34.400
Ex-gangster?!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.440
Esumi and I have been friends since we were little.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.090
Childhood friends...

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:43.940
I'm a little envious.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:48.450
It's not as great as you'd think.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.870
We both know each other's dark pasts, too. Right?

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.370
Yep.

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.130
I like that humans can be punched.

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.880
Yep.

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:04.960
<i>Wh-What have those two been through?</i>

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.430
Ogawa!

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:11.760
This is kinda out of nowhere, but do you
think humans or ghosts are scarier?

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:14.630
I wouldn't say either is scary,

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.270
but my favorite is somewhere in between.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:19.600
In between?

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:20.980
In between.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.100
<i>Ghosts and humans...</i>

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:36.340
<i>He asked which is scarier, but...</i>

00:08:52.990 --> 00:08:54.020
Watch out!

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:04.680
Are you okay?

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.020
What are you doing?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.050
Inoue!

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:22.750
Sheesh.

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:27.420
You're totally soaked now. Are you crazy?

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:29.470
Here.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:30.970
Wipe yourself off.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:33.430
Inoue...

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:39.490
Inoue,

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.660
if you'd seen her, you would have done the same thing.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.020
Did you say something?

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:45.740
Nope.

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:51.540
What's wrong, Amami?

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.730
Why do you look so sleepy again?

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:56.950
Actually...

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:00.280
The cat came after me in my dreams again...

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.290
What happened to the "heaven's wrath" guy?

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.510
He...

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:08.470
Heaven's wrath!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.100
Hooray for panties!

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.980
They were locked in a fierce battle.

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:24.200
Some roll-call samurai he is.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.890
Roll-call samurai?

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:28.220
He was the "present" guy, right?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.160
Call for aid!

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:31.650
Aid?

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:33.400
These.

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:38.120
I think these guys are wonderful!

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:42.350
They're trapped between life
and death by an unknown curse,

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:45.050
but they don't bemoan their circumstances at all.

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:46.170
They endure the persecution, and they're
still brave enough to chase their dreams...

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:49.000
Why is she carrying those around?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:51.770
That's what she meant by "in between"?

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:54.010
Are those handmade?

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:57.960
They're on your side!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.050
O-Okay...

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:12.940
U-Um...

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:15.280
Please, don't fight...

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.880
Barbarian fiends!

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:39.050
Why couldn't it be a bunch of chicks?!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:43.370
No!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:51.530
Please... Try to get along...

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:55.200
Take your seats.

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:57.990
I'm going to call the roll.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.190
Aizawa.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:00.990
Here.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:03.100
Akaishi.

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:03.990
Here.

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:08.500
I wonder if the ghosts will answer for her again.

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:10.500
Amami...

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:12.600
Prejent— Uh...

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:16.550
He said "prejent"!

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:18.010
Talk about embarrassing!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.540
I know, right?

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:24.230
Did the cat keep you up again?

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:29.550
You need more backup, then!

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:32.060
N-No, that wasn't it...

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:38.030
Actually, I've had something on my mind...

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.560
Hey, have you all heard?

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:47.960
There's a rumor going around.

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:51.970
On rainy days, when you have no umbrella...

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.980
Need an umbrella?

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:11.440
...asks a mysterious girl.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:18.390
Now give me your face in return!

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.510
Yamada, you jerk!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.560
Amami, have you heard about that?

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.580
Even Amami, the girl with the sixth sense...

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.050
...is going pale after hearing a ghost story.

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:41.460
Do you need to go to the bathroom?!

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:44.640
Is she possessed?

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.560
Don't say that, Esumi. What if it's true?

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:48.890
I-It's nothing like that!

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:54.230
That girl is the reason
I couldn't sleep again last night.

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.890
The truth is,

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:01.070
I walked home with her the other day.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.400
What?!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.780
I should've known!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:07.000
I declined the umbrella,

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:11.080
but only by coincidence.
I didn't know her story.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:14.580
I asked if she had any tips
for dealing with eyestrain.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:21.590
Then I learned she didn't even
have a face, let alone eyes.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:25.370
I feel so awful for asking that of her!

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:29.780
Th-That's the part that shocked you?

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:32.570
So that's why you couldn't sleep.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:45.450
What are you doing, Amami?

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:48.440
She wants to give that to the faceless ghost as an apology.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:54.690
<i>She comes out on rainy days
because she likes the rain.</i>

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:04.500
<i>Then this will...</i>

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:29.550
U-Um...

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:32.940
I'm sorry about the other day!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:40.590
Please accept this as my apology.

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:48.590
What's with the masochist rain doll?

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:51.180
Masochist?!

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:56.020
This'll probably bring more rain, not less.

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.120
Yes...

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.840
Don't humans hate rain
because they hate getting wet?

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.940
But when it rains...

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:08.070
I get to talk to you again.

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:14.330
You... have too much free time.

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.080
Indeed.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:18.840
Wanna share?

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:20.330
I do!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:31.800
You're making presents for the other ghosts, too?

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:35.110
She seemed really pleased with it.

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:37.680
Knitting them this time, huh?

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.960
It's been really cold, thanks to the rain.

00:16:41.570 --> 00:16:44.070
I wouldn't want them to catch a cold.

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:46.110
Can ghosts even catch colds?

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:50.870
I just want to thank all of them
for helping me so much.

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:52.160
"Helping you"?

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.500
Thank you!

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:07.800
Wow, that's amazing!

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:10.790
There's nothing there! I see nothing!

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:14.050
They really do help her.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:20.140
Are you going to give one to him, too?

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.490
The roll-call samurai.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:25.700
Oh, yeah, the one who said "prejent."

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:28.570
Yep! Prejent, prejent!

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:29.640
He really blew that one.

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.160
Who's this?

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.820
I did no such thing.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.350
I most certainly did no such thing!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:53.790
"Noritama is delicious"...

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:55.370
That makes no sense!

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.090
What's the problem, Uehara?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:02.340
Well, the roll-call samurai
just sent me a weird email.

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:03.940
The roll-call samurai?

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:06.270
Amami, the roll-call samurai—

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:13.160
Slashed right across my back...

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.780
You're not cut.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.230
Give me back my phone.

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:19.390
What was that noise?

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:22.570
Probably him warning us not to tell Amami.

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:25.700
Still, this anonymous message makes no sense.

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:28.110
Anonymous message?

00:18:28.110 --> 00:18:29.170
Yeah, there's no sender.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:35.120
I, Yoshida, a veritable cryptology expert due to
my experience in the mysteries of the world,

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:36.940
have already deduced the answer.

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:37.400
Since he's a samurai,
should we read it vertically?
have already deduced the answer.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.660
You all probably have no idea—

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.740
So this is it!

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:48.720
Yeah. This is where he said to meet us.

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.830
Why did I have to come, too?

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:52.730
Is this...

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:55.230
The roll-call samurai's grave?

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:03.740
"It was Lady Amami who restored my worn
and weathered grave to a pristine state."

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:10.490
"When she learned that I had starved to death,

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:14.940
she left me a bounty of rice and soup...

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.300
In a basin."

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:20.260
Wait for me!

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.720
S-Still in the rice cooker?

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:25.780
So he wants to repay her.

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:32.220
"I'd like you to give her a gift
on my behalf, and tell her...

00:19:32.760 --> 00:19:36.020
that the Noritama was truly exquisite."

00:19:36.020 --> 00:19:38.230
I was right about that part?!

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:47.240
I found the strange basin and odd utensils comical.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.670
Yet with each bite, my tears flowed.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.660
I pray that good fortune finds you.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.340
So the gift he mentioned...

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:19.220
This must be it.

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:30.820
Wow, look at them all!

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:35.050
I'll take good care of them.

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:39.310
<i>Well, if they all looked together,
I can believe they found that many.</i>

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:36.650
You all think Amami went to give
the roll-call samurai a present, too?

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:40.880
He'll email us if he wants to thank her again.

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:43.200
That's him.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.890
Isn't that...

00:21:48.890 --> 00:21:52.580
The roll-call samurai's in top form now.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:55.250
Darn it!

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:56.550
It's a mirage!

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:59.520
There is no ghost samurai!

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:01.170
Actually...

00:22:01.690 --> 00:22:03.930
He's too full of himself now.

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:06.110
It's pissing me off!

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:42.690
I'm Inoue Narumi.

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:46.940
I swear, ever since Amami
transferred here, it's been crazy.

00:23:46.940 --> 00:23:50.930
And now my bratty cousin's visiting
and being totally demanding!

00:23:50.930 --> 00:23:54.830
Where am I supposed to go
for some peace and quiet?

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:58.740
W-Well, it's not as if it bothers me, really.

00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:00.740
Hey, don't make me say that!

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:04.290
Next time on Re-Kan!:
"Delicious Fried Eggs."

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:09.600
Hey! Didn't Nana teach you to show
gratitude for your food before you eat?!
